{"term": {"label": "仁", "occurrences": 8, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "利", "id": "利"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "恩", "id": "恩"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "母", "id": "母"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "父", "id": "父"}, {"form": "獸", "id": "獸"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "異", "id": "異"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.8666607774011728, "source": "敵", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.272125885509337, "source": "敵", "target": "異"}, {"weight": 2.7421295147550726, "source": "恩", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 2.4056572781338597, "source": "恩", "target": "獸"}, {"weight": 0.768048488733063, "source": "利", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.6843392206072183, "source": "利", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.703509967595492, "source": "異", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.12036368224987509, "source": "異", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 0.4803664162812822, "source": "今", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.4056572781338597, "source": "今", "target": "獸"}, {"weight": 1.8666607774011728, "source": "今", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.272125885509337, "source": "今", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.40032370860774574, "source": "今", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.782951509275328, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.272125885509337, "source": "義", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 2.0898043287153825, "source": "義", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 0.12036368224987509, "source": "義", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.0898043287153825, "source": "政", "target": "母"}, {"weight": 1.316614440481901, "source": "政", "target"